From 61db26d2cc20372078b36e581d92eb7881eba4a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Suraj Gupta <suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2025 12:46:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 126/190] net: axienet: Use lp->ndev while unregistering
 network device to suppress smatch warning

commit bbc3cdbafbaef7aad6d8d151e73be82b4699ebca from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Use lp->ndev instead of ndev while unregistering network device
to suppress below smatch warning:
 xilinx_axienet_main.c:5639 axienet_probe()
 warn: 'lp->ndev' from register_netdev() not released on lines: 5639.

Signed-off-by: Suraj Gupta <suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
Fixes: aa62e1f27fd8 ("net: axienet: Add EOE GRO support for RX")
Message-ID: <20250917071612.186380-2-suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/xilinx/xilinx_axienet_main.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/xilinx/xilinx_axienet_main.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/xilinx/xilinx_axienet_main.c
index fcd6b097d805..d2567fb35b7e 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/xilinx/xilinx_axienet_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/xilinx/xilinx_axienet_main.c
@@ -5894,7 +5894,7 @@ static int axienet_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	return 0;
 
 err_unregister_netdev:
-	unregister_netdev(ndev);
+	unregister_netdev(lp->ndev);
 
 cleanup_phylink:
 	phylink_destroy(lp->phylink);
-- 
2.43.0

